ip","level":"Any degree","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"24 August 2026, 16:00 — main scholarship deadline closed","deadlineDate":"2026-08-24","status":"Closed","summary":"Regional right-to-study support assessed under ER.GO's economic, enrolment and merit rules, with separate guidance for families holding income or assets abroad.","tags":["DSU","Emilia-Romagna","Income assessed"],"source":"https://www.er-go.it/cosa-fare-per/bandi-di-concorso/leggi-il-bando","sourceLabel":"ER.GO official 2026–2027 call","checked":"13 October 2026"},{"id":"padua-international-excellence-2026-27","title":"Padua International Excellence Scholarship","provider":"University of Padua","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"2027–2028 award terms: verify on the official scholarship page","status":"Check official site","summary":"The 2026–2027 scheme offered €8,000 gross per year plus a tuition-fee exemption for selected international students in eligible English-taught degrees.","tags":["Padua","Merit","English-taught degree"],"source":"https://www.unipd.it/en/padua-international-excellence-scholarship-programme","sourceLabel":"University of Padua","checked":"13 October 2026","featured":true},{"id":"open-doors-2026","title":"Open Doors: 2026 competition for study in Russia","provider":"Global Universities Association","type":"Scholarship","level":"Graduate","supportedDegrees":["Bachelor's","Master's","PhD"],"country":"Russia","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"Registration: 1 November 2026; confirm account cut-off","deadlineDate":"2026-11-01","status":"Open","summary":"Tuition-free study routes with university-dependent stipend; additional support has separate conditions. Choose the correct academic track and follow the official stages.","tags":["Bachelor’s","Master’s","PhD","Track-specific rules"],"source":"https://od.globaluni.ru/","sourceLabel":"Official Open Doors rules