":"Conditions for the full degree, not just year one"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1f:["$","section","5-Keep a small, evidence-based shortlist",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep a small, evidence-based shortlist"}],[["$","p","For each option, save the official source, cycle, nationality or residence conditions, programme, required documents and deadline. Mark a condition as unconfirmed when the current source is silent. A pending call is not an open application.",{"children":"For each option, save the official source, cycle, nationality or residence conditions, programme, required documents and deadline. Mark a condition as unconfirmed when the current source is silent. A pending call is not an open application."}],["$","p","Prepare documents around the earliest dependent task. References, school nomination, programme admission and a scholarship form may have separate dates. Keep academic fit and net cost visible so a well-written application does not lead to an unaffordable offer.",{"children":"Prepare documents around the earliest dependent task. References, school nomination, programme admission and a scholarship form may have separate dates. Keep academic fit and net cost visible so a well-written application does not lead to an unaffordable offer."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Keep a small, evidence-based shortlist","children":[["$","$L4","/scholarships/lester-b-pearson/",{"href":"/scholarships/lester-b-pearson/","children":["Pearson nomination and application",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/scholarship-application/",{"href":"/guides/scholarship-application/","children":["Build your evidence bank",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","class